+      <div class="bd-title">Agent Team</div>
+      <div class="bd-desc">A group of agents with roles and a coordinator. The unit of <em>intelligence bundling</em>. You install a Crew to get multiple specialized agents working together.</div>
+      <ul>
+        <li>Contains: 2–N agent blocks</li>
+        <li>Has: coordinator agent, role assignments</li>
+        <li>Installs as: a multi-agent conversation participant</li>
+        <li>Analogy: a consulting team</li>
+      </ul>
+    </div>
+    <div class="bd-col bd-rig">
+      <div class="bd-label">Block Type 9 — Rig Pack</div>
+      <div class="bd-title">Tool + Context Bundle</div>
+      <div class="bd-desc">A bundle of MCP servers + chub context hubs that any agent can use. The unit of <em>capability bundling</em>. You install a Rig Pack to give any agent a new skill domain.</div>
+      <ul>
+        <li>Contains: 1–N MCP tool servers + 1–N chub blocks</li>
+        <li>Has: a single endpoint URL, role-based access, per-user credentials</li>
+        <li>Installs as: a capability layer loaded into any agent or Crew</li>
+        <li>Analogy: a professional toolkit (wrench set, not the plumber)</li>
+      </ul>
+    </div>
